@flexiarg writing-coherence/meet-the-reader-where-they-are
@title Meet the Reader Where They Are

  + IF: A principled abstraction must remain rigorous while becoming legible to an operational reader.

  + HOWEVER: Rewriting everything as a project plan destroys openness, while leaving it unanchored makes the document appear evasive.

  + BECAUSE: Minimal operational anchors let the reader land without carrying the argument or replacing its abstraction.

  + THEN: Add parenthetical and elidable anchors, and restate the abstraction's disclaimer in the same eyeshot.
